{"user": "After c8, what legal moves would White have left? I'm trying to get a sense of whether c8 opens up corners for White later.", "user_ts": "2026-08-14T21:27:02.756904+00:00", "assistant": "After Black plays **c8**, White\u2019s legal moves would be:\n\n**a1, a3, b6, b7, b8**\n\nMost important: **a1 is a corner**, so yes\u2014after **c8**, White can immediately take the **a1 corner**. **h1** and **a8** are not legal for White right away, but giving up any corner in the endgame is a big deal because corners can\u2019t be flipped back.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-14T21:27:02.756904+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-14T21:27:07.756904+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 2, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 3, "Metacomment": 1}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 0.6666666666666666, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 1.0, "Metacomment": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question", "Metacomment"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Move Verdict": 1, "Negative Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Move Verdict": 0.3333333333333333, "Negative Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Move Verdict", "Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Fee